eighed heavily on Dalal Street sentiment.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/the-great-indian-stock-market-comeback-can-the-rally-sustain-and-what-should-investors-do/articleshow/136092236.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136092236,imgsize-202590.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/the-great-indian-stock-market-comeback-can-the-rally-sustain-and-what-should-investors-do/articleshow/136092236.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:09:55 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[ITC Share Price Highlights: ITC Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/itc-share-price-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136089671.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136089671,imgsize-9740.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/itc-share-price-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136089671.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:13:06 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tata Motors PV Share Price Highlights: Tata Motors PV Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/tata-motors-pv-stock-price-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136089652.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136089652,imgsize-32224.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/tata-motors-pv-stock-price-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136089652.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:12:27 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Adani Ent Share Price Highlights: Adani Ent. Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog